  "prefLabel": "En 708.01 E-5 - Utility Accident Report",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 708.01 E-5 - Utility Accident Report.\n\n(a) Each sewer utility shall complete and file with the department and the commission a department “Form E-5S, Utility Accident Report,” revised March 2024, available on the department’s website at www.energy.nh.gov, within 10 working days of when a sewer utility accident, as described in En 707.03 (a) and (d), occurs.\n\nSource. #13912, eff 3-21-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 700)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en700.html"
